Head to the motel l was talking about.
You'll be safe there.

223
00:17:43,563 --> 00:17:46,690
-What are you two gonna do?
-Oh, no.

224
00:17:46,858 --> 00:17:49,359
Oh, come on.

225
00:17:55,450 --> 00:17:56,533
Oh, come on!

226
00:18:01,456 --> 00:18:04,875
Dude, the guns are gone. So's the....

227
00:18:07,003 --> 00:18:09,379
Basically everything is gone.

228
00:18:09,547 --> 00:18:12,257
