Go.

270
00:20:44,368 --> 00:20:48,663
Hey, Fonzie. Question for you.

271
00:20:48,831 --> 00:20:51,333
This indestructible force field
made out of salt?

272
00:20:52,501 --> 00:20:55,378
-Have to be kosher stuff or what?
-Knock it off, Ted.

273
00:20:59,258 --> 00:21:00,675
[CREAKING]

274
