309
00:23:44,673 --> 00:23:48,134
-l am not going in there either.
-Yes, you are. It is the best defense.

310
00:23:48,302 --> 00:23:52,597
Windows are boarded. lt's got one door.
It's our best shot right now. Trust me.

311
