No.

333
00:28:03,432 --> 00:28:06,434
No? Well, where's Ted?

334
00:28:06,602 --> 00:28:07,769
He's outside.

335
00:28:08,854 --> 00:28:11,397
Well, why doesn't he come inside?

336
00:28:14,735 --> 00:28:16,944
Because I had to carry him out.

337
00:28:18,113 --> 00:28:20,490
-l'm sorry.
SUSAN: You're...?

338
00:28:21,075 --> 00:28:23,659
What does that mean?
What does that mean, you're sorry?

339
00:28:23,869 --> 00:28:25,620
Are you saying that he's dead?

340
00:28:25,871 --> 00:28:29,791
No. No, he's not saying that he's dead.
You're not saying that, are you?

341
00:28:29,958 --> 00:28:32,418
We were in the walls, and she attacked.

342
00:28:33,962 --> 00:28:36,297
And l couldn't get to him in time.

343
00:28:39,385 --> 00:28:40,968
Uncle Ted is dead?

344
