I shouldn't have left him alone.

345
00:28:49,812 --> 00:28:51,145
I'm very sorry.

346
00:29:04,410 --> 00:29:09,122
BRlAN: We'll find him, Suse. We will.
-Where else is there to look?

347
00:29:09,289 --> 00:29:10,957
-Danny's dead, isn't he?
BRlAN: No, Suse.

348
00:29:11,125 --> 00:29:14,001
He is. Why not? She killed my brother.
Now she killed my son.

349
00:29:14,169 --> 00:29:15,378
No, Danny is alive.

350
