Dean.

377
00:31:15,123 --> 00:31:16,749
We gotta talk.

378
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:19,502
-What is that?
-Rebecca's diary.

379
00:31:19,670 --> 00:31:22,964
-l just finished reading it.
-And?

380
00:31:23,131 --> 00:31:26,634
That girl back there?
Pretty sure she was Rebecca's daughter.

381
00:31:26,802 --> 00:31:28,970
-Rebecca had a kid?
-lt's all she talks about.

382
00:31:29,137 --> 00:31:31,847
Being pregnant,
being ashamed of being pregnant.

383
00:31:32,057 --> 00:31:35,476
Jeez, rent Juno and get over it.
Wait, why kill herself after the baby?

384
00:31:35,644 --> 00:31:37,979
Maybe because her dad
called her a dirty whore...

385
00:31:38,146 --> 00:31:40,273
...and said he was gonna
lock the baby up.

386
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:42,316
Why would he say that?

387
00:31:45,946 --> 00:31:47,989
-Oh, gross.
-Yeah.

388
00:31:48,156 --> 00:31:52,201
