-Dude was a monster, Dean.

389
00:31:52,828 --> 00:31:56,163
Wow, a story ripped
from an Austrian headline.

390
00:31:56,665 --> 00:31:58,082
Humans, man.

391
00:31:59,084 --> 00:32:02,169
-So she's been locked up her whole life?
-You saw her eyes.

392
00:32:02,337 --> 00:32:04,463
Has she ever seen light?
She's barely human.

393
00:32:04,631 --> 00:32:06,549
So she's been caged up like an animal...

394
00:32:06,717 --> 00:32:10,803
...and she busts out
and ganks dear old Dad-slash-Granddad?

395
00:32:11,179 --> 00:32:12,179
I guess.

396
00:32:12,347 --> 00:32:15,391
-Well, can't say l blame her.
-l'm sure her life was hell.

397
00:32:15,601 --> 00:32:17,476
Doesn't mean she gets a pass for murder.

398
00:32:17,644 --> 00:32:21,022
-Like you know what hell's like.
-l didn't....

399
00:32:21,189 --> 00:32:22,857
Forget it.

400
00:32:23,692 --> 00:32:26,027
So where do we find her?

401
00:32:29,114 --> 00:32:31,198
Kid's gotta eat, right?

402
00:32:32,534 --> 00:32:34,035
What?

403
00:32:34,620 --> 00:32:38,581
He kept her hidden, locked up,
but he had to feed her, didn't he?

404
00:32:38,749 --> 00:32:40,207
I guess.

405
00:32:40,375 --> 00:32:42,501
I think I know where.

406
00:33:03,398 --> 00:33:06,067
[GRUNTlNG]

407
00:33:15,952 --> 00:33:17,578
[MUFFLED SCREAM]

408
00:33:39,393 --> 00:33:41,477
[MUFFLED SCREAMlNG]

409
