418
00:35:43,391 --> 00:35:45,184
[WHlSPERS]
Danny.

419
00:35:50,398 --> 00:35:51,857
Danny.

420
00:35:52,025 --> 00:35:54,026
[MUFFLED SCREAMlNG]

421
