443
00:38:21,716 --> 00:38:23,384
BRlAN:
Suse!

444
00:38:46,491 --> 00:38:48,909
[KATE CRYING]

445
00:39:25,363 --> 00:39:27,114
Thanks for the head start.

446
00:39:27,282 --> 00:39:30,075
Why doesn't it surprise me
you guys don't like the police?

447
00:39:30,243 --> 00:39:33,579
It's sort of
a mutual-appreciation thing, really.

448
00:39:34,873 --> 00:39:38,751
