465
00:40:55,036 --> 00:40:58,205
-What?
-l enjoyed it, Sam.

466
00:41:01,126 --> 00:41:05,337
They took me off the rack,
and l tortured souls, and l liked it.

467
00:41:07,799 --> 00:41:11,969
All those years, all that pain.

468
00:41:12,137 --> 00:41:15,180
Finally getting to deal some out yourself.

469
00:41:16,307 --> 00:41:19,059
I didn't care who they put in front of me.

470
00:41:19,644 --> 00:41:22,980
Because that pain I felt...

471
00:41:23,148 --> 00:41:25,440
...it just slipped away.

472
00:41:27,694 --> 00:41:30,612
No matter how many people l save...

473
00:41:31,614 --> 00:41:33,866
...l can't change that.

474
00:41:36,244 --> 00:41:38,704
